The VT parser buffer in vt-parser.c defines fixed size limits that create natural backpressure. The BUF_SZ constant of 1MB limits how much pending escape sequence data can accumulate. The MAX_ESCAPE_CODE_LENGTH of BUF_SZ/4 prevents any single escape code from consuming too much buffer.

```c
