#define BUF_SZ (1024u*1024u)
// The extra bytes are so loads of large integers such as for AVX 512 dont read past the end of the buffer
#define BUF_EXTRA (512u/8u)
#define MAX_ESCAPE_CODE_LENGTH (BUF_SZ / 4u)
#define MAX_CSI_PARAMS 256u
```

Visible signs of backpressure appear in several forms. When the input buffer fills completely, rendering may pause momentarily as the system catches up. The terminal continues accepting input but processes it in chunks. Graphics commands that exceed quota limits return ENOSPC errors visible in the response stream.

